---
interface Props {
  id: string;
}
const { id } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="page" id={id}>
  <!-- FRONT: Mathematics -->
  <div class="front bg-slate-50 border-l border-slate-300 relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Math formulas whisper -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-6 right-8 opacity-[0.06] font-hand text-[9px] text-rose-900 space-y-0.5 pointer-events-none text-right">
      <p>a² + b² = c²</p>
      <p>∫₀¹ x² dx = ⅓</p>
      <p>n! = n × (n-1)!</p>
      <p>φ = (1+√5)/2</p>
    </div>
    <!-- Graph doodle -->
    <div class="absolute top-6 right-8 opacity-[0.05] pointer-events-none rotate-3">
      <svg width="75" height="55" viewBox="0 0 90 60" class="stroke-rose-800 fill-none" stroke-width="0.8">
        <line x1="10" y1="50" x2="85" y2="50" stroke-dasharray="2 2"/>
        <line x1="10" y1="5" x2="10" y2="50" stroke-dasharray="2 2"/>
        <path d="M 10 45 Q 25 8, 45 30 T 85 10" />
        <text x="65" y="48" class="text-[5px] font-serif" fill="currentColor" stroke="none">x</text>
        <text x="12" y="10" class="text-[5px] font-serif" fill="currentColor" stroke="none">y</text>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-6 text-[9px] font-serif text-slate-300 italic">— 8 —</div>

    <div class="p-14 h-full flex flex-col relative z-10">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b-4 border-rose-500 pb-3 mb-4">
        <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500"></div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-rose-950 uppercase tracking-tighter">Matematika</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-slate prose-sm font-serif space-y-2 flex-1">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-rose-800 uppercase tracking-widest">Materi OSN SMP</h4>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-600 space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed">
          <ul class="list-none pl-0 space-y-2 mt-2">
            <li class="flex gap-2 items-start">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="text-[8px] font-bold text-rose-600">1</span></span>
              <div><strong class="text-rose-900">Aljabar:</strong> <span class="text-slate-500">Polinomial, SPLDV/PLSV, ketidaksamaan, nilai mutlak, fungsi.</span></div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-2 items-start">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="text-[8px] font-bold text-rose-600">2</span></span>
              <div><strong class="text-rose-900">Geometri:</strong> <span class="text-slate-500">Lingkaran, segitiga, bangun ruang, dalil Pythagoras, Ptolemy, sinh-cosh.</span></div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-2 items-start">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="text-[8px] font-bold text-rose-600">3</span></span>
              <div><strong class="text-rose-900">Teori Bilangan:</strong> <span class="text-slate-500">Kongruensi, sisa, FPB/KPK, bilangan prima, fungsi Euler.</span></div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-2 items-start">
              <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded bg-yellow-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><span class="text-[8px] font-bold text-yellow-600">4</span></span>
              <div><strong class="text-rose-900">Kombinatorika:</strong> <span class="bg-yellow-200/40 px-1 rounded text-slate-600 border-b border-dashed border-rose-300">Peluang, Prinsip Penyebaran & Penyerepan (PHP), Pigeonhole.</span></div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Important formulas -->
        <div class="mt-2 p-3 bg-rose-50/60 border border-rose-100 rounded-lg">
          <p class="text-[9px] font-bold text-rose-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Rumus Kunci:</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-[10px] text-rose-800 font-hand">
            <p>a² + b² = c²</p>
            <p>nCr = n! / r!(n-r)!</p>
            <p>nPr = n! / (n-r)!</p>
            <p>P(A∪B) = P(A)+P(B)-P(A∩B)</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-2 flex justify-end">
        <button onclick="window.flipPage(5)" class="text-xs font-serif italic text-rose-700 hover:text-rose-900 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">Next Page <i data-feather="arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4"></i></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- BACK: Join CTA -->
  <div class="back bg-slate-50 border-r border-slate-300 shadow-inner relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-6 text-[9px] font-serif text-slate-300 italic">— 9 —</div>

    <div class="p-14 h-full flex flex-col relative z-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-800 border-b border-slate-200 pb-3 mb-5 uppercase tracking-tight">Bersiap untuk OSN</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-4 flex-1">
        <p class="text-[12px] text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-serif">
          Persiapan matang adalah kunci. Mulai dari memahami materi, berlatih soal-soal OSN tahun sebelumnya, hingga mengikuti tryout.
        </p>

        <!-- Tips -->
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <span class="text-[8px] font-bold text-teal-600">✓</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Kuasai konsep dasar sebelum ke soal tingkat lanjut.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <span class="text-[8px] font-bold text-teal-600">✓</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Latihan soal OSN 5 tahun terakhir.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <span class="text-[8px] font-bold text-teal-600">✓</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-600">Diskusi dengan teman dan pembina.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sticky note CTA -->
        <div class="rotate-1 bg-yellow-100 p-4 shadow-md border border-yellow-200 relative max-w-[250px]">
          <div class="absolute -top-2.5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-12 h-3 bg-slate-400/15 rounded-sm"></div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-amber-900 text-[11px] mb-1 uppercase font-serif">Ayo Join SINAPS!</h4>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-amber-700/70 font-hand leading-relaxed">Hubungi Pembina OSN untuk info lebih lanjut.</p>
        </div>

        <p class="font-hand text-[10px] text-slate-400/50 italic mt-2">"Mathematics is the queen of the sciences." — Gauss</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-2 flex justify-start">
        <button onclick="window.flipPage(-5)" class="text-xs font-serif italic text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-700 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"><i data-feather="arrow-left" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Back Page</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
